NASA API & THIRD-PARTY DATA
This application retrieves data from the NASA Astronomy Picture of the Day
(APOD) API (https://api.nasa.gov). NASA imagery, video, and related content
are provided by NASA and are subject to NASA's terms of use and media
guidelines. See: https://www.nasa.gov/nasa-brand-center/images-and-media/

NASA data and media are separate from this Software's source code. Use of
NASA content must comply with NASA's applicable policies. Gagan Joshi does
not claim ownership of NASA-provided data or imagery.

